~ start
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: Hello!
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: My name is {{QuizManager.current_teacher.getFullName()}}. It's a pleasure to meet you.
do QuizManager.setDisplayedName(QuizManager.current_teacher.getFormalName())
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: Today's quiz will be "{{QuizManager.getQuizName()}}".
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: But before we start... What is your name?
do QuizManager.promptInput()
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: Nice to meet you {{QuizManager.user_name}}! Welcome to today's quiz.
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: I'll be asking you a few questions. Do your best!
do QuizManager.startQuiz("res://csvImports/templates/GENERAL TRIVIA.csv")
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: Well done for finishing the quiz!
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: You scored {{QuizManager.score}} out of {{QuizManager.total}}!
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: Here's your certificate...
do QuizManager.showCompletionImage()
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: Thanks for participating. 
{{QuizManager.getDisplayedName()}}: I will see you soon!
do QuizManager.goToMenu()
=> END